# Runtime/cache/state
**/.cache/
**/cache/
**/state/
**/*.log
**/*.pid

# Heavy/private media
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.webm

# Backups and temporary files
**/backups/
**/*.bak
**/*~
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets / tokens / credentials
**/secrets*
**/*secret*
**/*token*
**/*password*
**/*credential*
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/known_hosts
